# Vharn Dominion: an insect empire. Low hunched carapace domes in segmented bands, bone ribs
# standing proud of the walls, amber resin slits and mandible spikes at every gate.
#
# Grids run bottom layer first. In a grid, rows go north to south and columns west to east.
# Reserved: space (outside the module), . (air inside), D (socket), X (way in from outside),
# $ loot, T terminal, C core, ! spawn, B boss, ? story prop, ^ v < > ramps rising that way.

kit vharn
name Vharn Dominion
faction vharn
light ffa040

panels 8 4 0.25
facade 1a0c18 cdb98f cdb98f

alien
rooms keep

palette
  #  cube   chitin  2a1328|301630|26112a  wall    plum-black carapace plates
  %  cube   chitin  5c1c38|66203f         wall    oxblood segment bands
  _  cube   resin   2a1824|2f1b29         floor
  =  cube   chitin  381a34|3e1d3a         roof
  *  cube   lumen   ffa040                light   amber resin lamps
  w  pane   lumen   e8892e                window  lit amber membrane
  o  rib    bone    d9c8a0|cdbb92         wall    bone ribs
  s  spike  bone    e9dcc0                decor   mandible spikes
  k  cube   bone    cdb98f|d8c6a0         decor   bone trim
  e  pod    lumen   d98a3a                decor   brood eggs
  /  ramp   resin   3a2034                floor
  u  cube   resin   2a1824                floor

